			"Message": "refactor(Project): Wire state handlers to trait implementations\n\nCross-cutting submodule sync wiring Mountain handlers to proper trait implementations for state persistence:\n1. Mountain: Replace direct Sky event emissions with trait methods - SCM handlers use SourceControlManagementProvider to materialize state in ApplicationState::SourceControl, StatusBar handlers use StatusBarProvider::SetStatusBarEntry for ActiveStatusBarItems, Webview handlers use WebviewProvider trait for ApplicationState::WebviewState, Search handlers delegate to WorkspaceProvider::FindFilesInWorkspace and SearchProvider::TextSearch\n2. Output: Remove Configuration directory (ESBuild, Plugin, Polyfill, Service configs and tsconfig)\n3. Cocoon: Submodule sync to cbaf44f1\n\nImpact: SCM providers, status bar items, and webview panels now properly persist in Mountain's ApplicationState. File and text search use ignore-aware implementations.",
